# =============================================================================
# Selene repo root  v1.0  (2026-09-21)
# Root is "AI Generation Flow" because the live code hard-wires SIBLING paths:
#   educational/config_edu.py  -> ../selene-dreams-script-v3.0 (.env, creds, modules)
#   v3.0/reel_config.py:257    -> ../selene-dreams-educational-v1.0/fonts
#   v3.0/config.py:150         -> ../reference-images
# Splitting these into separate repos breaks all three. Do not restructure
# without changing those three files first.
#
# Only the two live lanes + the two loose runners are tracked. Everything
# else at this level is media, docs or dead code and stays local.
# =============================================================================

# --- dead generations: contain live OAuth credentials, never commit ----------
selene-dreams-script/
selene-dreams-script-v2.0/
selene-dreams-video-v1.0/

# --- media + docs: large, binary, not needed to run --------------------------
reference-images/
_Design/
_User Guide Kit/
_archive/
_knowledge-uploads/
*.mp4
*.pptx
*.pdf

# --- OS / tooling ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.claude/
__pycache__/
.venv/
*.bak*
